WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:04.921
It's another Mask.

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:08.299
I have to kill it.

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:12.887
At this distance,
it's perfect for shooting practice.

00:00:15.223 --> 00:00:16.057
What?

00:00:16.641 --> 00:00:18.810
Did I just say "practice"?

00:00:19.477 --> 00:00:21.146
Right before murdering someone?

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:24.357
Wait, Masks aren't people.

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:28.570
Even so, maybe I'm losing my mind too?

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:31.072
Is she letting me go?

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:44.586
Whoa…

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:54.554
What?

00:01:04.355 --> 00:01:07.776
I should've just shot her
without thinking so much!

00:01:07.859 --> 00:01:09.235
You monster!

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.074
You…

00:01:20.371 --> 00:01:22.290
She's not coming to kill me?

00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:25.710
Is she feeling me out? Then…

00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:29.798
Just to let you know, I'm jumping off now.

00:01:30.882 --> 00:01:33.218
I totally give up now.

00:01:33.301 --> 00:01:34.803
Seems like she understands.

00:01:34.886 --> 00:01:37.305
-I'll jump now.
-I just need a good distraction.

00:01:41.392 --> 00:01:42.727
We're so high up.

00:01:43.311 --> 00:01:46.731
You know, it seems like
my big brother is in this world too.

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:50.819
If you see him, let him know that I died.

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:56.449
My name is… Yuri Honjo.

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:11.339
That's right.

00:02:11.422 --> 00:02:14.926
Masks check to see
if they actually committed suicide.

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:17.762
This is the only chance I've got!

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:20.515
Take that!

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:28.773
I did it, but…

00:02:29.524 --> 00:02:32.443
That hurts!

00:02:33.027 --> 00:02:35.947
But I defeated that monster!

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:38.449
This pain is nothing!

